Software is Dead?

Software is an utility built around business/problems. Problem exists and will always exist. But way to solve problem has become easier. 
A software requires these parts 
1. frontend which runs on browser/mobile apps. This requires maintainence or operational cost on domain, app store per year cost, requires updates as per the guidelines of 
    mobile app platforms. Creating is one thing, maintainence is another thing. If you are not passionate about what you build or it is not profitable or worth giving time & money, 
    you will not maintain it. so it will be ruled out automatically 
2. Backend or database which runs on server. This requires maintainence or operational cost on server, database, payment gateway, third party APIs, etc. To create 
    software for self or the world, you need to set up server. No one want to host software on server which doesn't product outcome, can be solved by free provider
3. Distribution: If no one use your app, then it is just a personal project. Making ur product visible is important to be it sold. 

